milestone: "2026.04.74"
title: "Governance Surgery + Live Probe Validation + Math Repair SOTA v3 + DualGPU Wiring"
description: |
  Milestone .73 produced three historically strong results (Symbolic-KAN AUC=1.0,
  SpilledEnergy AUROC=1.0, ThinkPRM AUROC=0.99) but all are CPU/synthetic only.
  Exp 942 (SOTA math repair) never ran. Exp 786/627/603/641 have appeared for 4-14
  consecutive milestones without result. DualGPU has been idle for 8 milestones post-
  benchmark. .74 fixes all four structural issues before adding new research.
based_on_milestone: "2026.04.73"
experiments:

  - id: exp952
    title: "Preflight v23 — Exclusion Manifest Surgery + SOTA Pre-Download + Arxiv Scan"
    priority: critical
    requires_gpu: false
    max_turns: 20
    estimated_wall_time_min: 20
    description: |
      Three mandatory governance actions before any .74 experiment runs:
      (1) Update ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml — add exp786, exp627, exp603, exp641 with
          documented retirement rationale. These have appeared for 4-14 consecutive
          milestones with zero progress; further carryover is burn without benefit.
      (2) Pre-download SOTA GGUFs needed by .74 GPU experiments:
          - unsloth/gemma-4-31B-it-GGUF (for Exp 953, 954, 959)
          - unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF (for Exp 953, 959)
          - unsloth/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF (for Exp 959)
          Download to ~/.cache/huggingface/hub/ and verify file sizes. Write a
          sota_preflight_status artifact noting which models are ready.
      (3) Add 3 new arxiv papers to research-references.md if not already present:
          - arXiv 2502.11250 (Uncertainty-Aware Step Verification via CoT Entropy)
          - arXiv 2604.20701 (Divide-and-Conquer NN Surrogates for Sparse Ising)
          - arXiv 2602.17750 (iCKANs: Constitutive KANs with symbolic regression)
      Write result artifact at results/experiment_952_preflight_v23.json with fields:
        manifest_entries_added: [list of experiment IDs]
        sota_models_ready: {model_name: bool}
        arxiv_papers_filed: [list]
        honest_verdict: "preflight_complete" | "preflight_partial"
    result_schema:
      honest_verdict: str
      manifest_entries_added: list
      sota_models_ready: dict
      arxiv_papers_filed: list

  - id: exp953
    title: "Math Repair SOTA v3 — Gemma4-31B with Result-Write Guard"
